        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Directions",
            "icon": "washing",
            "content": "<p>Directions<br/>Wet your hands with clean, running water. Apply a small amount of hand soap.  Lather the soap by rubbing hands together. Scrub for at least 20 seconds. Rinse hands well. Dry hands using a clean, dry towel.<br/><br/>100% biodegradable. <br/>Septic & greywater-safe.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "icon": "plant",
            "content": "<p>High-Purity Water, Sodium Coco-Sulfate, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine, Sodium Benzoate*, Potassium Sorbate*,  Sodium Gluconate, Essential Oils and/or Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oils, Phenoxyethanol*, Caprylyl Glycol*, Citric Acid <br/><br/>*Preservatives used sparingly, help prevent bacteria growth in container</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Scent",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "content": "<p><em>All of our scents are made with  –</em></p><p><strong>Pure essential oils</strong> • hand selected by us from small farms all around the world.</p><p><em>and/or</em></p><p><strong>Phthalate-free fragrance oils</strong> • aromatic compounds made of GRAS safe synthetics. Certified free of the 624 carcinogens and 323 reproductive/developmental toxins listed under the <a href=\"https://oehha.ca.gov/proposition-65/proposition-65-list\" target=\"_blank\">Prop 65 act</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_LLBABz": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredient Descriptions",
            "icon": "eye",
            "content": "<p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-charcoal-filtered-deionized-water-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is High-Purity Water (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-treated) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>High-Purity Water</strong></a> (charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis,<br/>UV-treated)</p><p><strong>Sodium Coco-Sulfate</strong> (coconut-based surfactant)</p><p><strong>Cocamidopropyl Betaine</strong> (coconut-based surfactant)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-cocamidopropyl-hydroxysultaine-sultaine-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine (Sultaine) and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine</strong></a> (coconut-based surfactant)</p><p><strong>Sodium Benzoate</strong> (food-grade preservative, used sparingly,<br/>helps prevent bacteria growth in container)</p><p><strong>Potassium Sorbate</strong> (food-grade preservative, used sparingly,<br/>helps prevent bacteria growth in container)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-sodium-gluconate-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Sodium Gluconate and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Sodium Gluconate</strong></a> (skin conditioner)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-are-essential-oils\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What are Essential Oils?\"><strong>Essential oils </strong></a>and/ or <a href=\"/blogs/tips-tricks/why-we-scent-safely-and-how-to-boost-your-laundrys-smell\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Why We Scent Safely and How To Boost Your Laundry's Smell\"><strong>phthalate-free fragrance oils</strong></a> (scent, if scented)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Phenoxyethanol in Personal Care Products: What You Need to Know\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a> (highly-purified preservative, used<br/>sparingly, helps prevent bacteria growth in container)</p><p><strong>Caprylyl Glycol</strong> (preservative derived from coconuts, used<br/>sparingly, helps prevent bacteria growth in container)</p><p><a href=\"/blogs/ingredients-we-stand-by/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is Citric Acid and what does it do in products?\"><strong>Citric Acid</strong></a> (balances pH)</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_D4NhUJ": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the differences between Affordable • Effective • Plant-Based and Rustic Strength's Main Line?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p><em><strong>Rustic Strength</strong></em> is plant-based and 100% biodegradable. It has highly concentrated active ingredients with little to no impurities. It doesn't take as much product to do the job effectively. These concentrated, high-quality, active ingredients are reflected in the price.</p><p><em><strong>Affordable • Effective • Plant-Based</strong></em> is also plant-based and 100% biodegradable. While its active ingredients are not as concentrated, it still does the job. These ingredients are of higher quality than those in Seventh Generation and are far superior to the toxic ingredients used by mega corporations like Unilever and P&G.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_E7Qafr": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does this product come with a pump?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p>We do not automatically provide a pump or spout with our products because our goal is to reduce waste.</p><p>If you would like a pump or spout, we offer options as an add-on in our accessory section. </p><ul><li><a href=\"/products/1-gallon-glass-or-plastic-container-pump\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pump | fits 1 Gallon Glass or Plastic Jug\">Gallon (Glass or Plastic) Jug Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/how-to-assemble-the-wide-mouth-jar-pump\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Wide-Mouth Jar Pump Help\">1 Gallon Wide Mouth Jar Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/eco-jug-help\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Eco-Jug Help\">Eco Jug Accessories</a></li><li><a href=\"/products/bucket-dispenser-pump-5-gallon\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Bucket Pump | fits 5 Gallon Bucket\">Bucket Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/collections/drum-pumps\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"drum pumps\">Drum Pumps</a></li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
